		{
			dependencies: [
				"3C270BED91FBA850"
				"136EE0B368AA6649"
			]
			description: ["虚空中的众多实体被释放了出来。"]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "minecraft:written_book"
				tag: {
					author: "The Archivist"
					display: { }
					pages: [
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"It began in the underground laboratories beneath the Kremlin. Stalin, no longer content with conquering nations, had set his gaze upon the cosmos, not the stars, but what lay beneath them. \"},{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"light_purple\",\"text\":\"The VOID\"},{\"text\":\".\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"The absence between realities. A place no man was meant to see.\\nBeside him stood \"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\", the empire’s greatest mind. His obsession with dark matter had consumed him. He had long theorized that the universe was stitched together by an invisible thread.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"the VOID. Not just emptiness, but a living force.\\n\\\"I’ve done it,\\\" \"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" whispered, trembling as he showed Stalin a vial of black liquid, dark matter harvested from a collapsed star. \\\"This… this is the key.\\\"\\nStalin nodded, his eyes gleaming. \\\"Then let us open the door.\\\"\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"The facility, codenamed \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"Kolmograd-Void\"},{\"text\":\", was built in Siberia, where no one could hear what would follow. Beneath layers of reinforced steel and lead, the experiments began.\\n \"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" constructed a rift engine, fueled by the dark matter and powered by stolen knowledge from forgotten civilizations.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"As the device spun to life, the walls began to shake. The air grew thin. And then, silence. A black hole the size of a coin floated in the air, pulsing, whispering.\\n\\\"The \"},{\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"light_purple\",\"text\":\"VOID\"},{\"text\":\" is calling,\\\" \"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" said.\\nStalin felt it too. A presence. Watching. Listening.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"text\":\"They called it a success. But the world outside began to decay. Time slowed in Kolmograd. Clocks ticked backward. Scientists spoke in tongues in their sleep. Shadows moved when no one did.\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" grew more erratic, speaking to voices only he could hear.\\n\\\"It’s alive, Stalin. The \"},{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"light_purple\",\"text\":\"VOID…\"},{\"text\":\" it knows us. It’s \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"learning\"},{\"text\":\".\\\"\\nStill, Stalin pushed forward. “We control it. We always have. The USSR bows to no god.”\\nBut \"},{\"color\":\"red\",\"text\":\"Unknown\"},{\"text\":\" had already awakened.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"On the 40th day, the rift screamed. Sirens wailed as the air turned to ash. One by one, the researchers vanished — not into death, but into \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"somewhere else\"},{\"text\":\".\\n\"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" stood before the portal, his eyes pitch black. “I see it now. It’s beautiful.”\\n \"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Stalin tried to shut the reactor down, but the controls melted in his hands. From the VOID emerged a figure  shifting, faceless, cloaked in screaming darkness. \"},{\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"red\",\"text\":\"Unknown\"},{\"bold\":true,\"text\":\".\"},{\"text\":\"\\n \"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"\\\"You tore open the gate,\\\" \"},{\"color\":\"red\",\"text\":\"Unknown\"},{\"text\":\" growled, his voice the sound of dying stars. \\\"Now it must feed.\\\"\\n\"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" laughed madly. “Take me!”\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Stalin turned to run, but the \"},{\"color\":\"light_purple\",\"text\":\"VOID\"},{\"text\":\" pulsed. Gravity fractured. The world bent like wax.\\n\"},{\"color\":\"red\",\"text\":\"Unknown\"},{\"text\":\" reached out with a hand of pure shadow and \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"pulled\"},{\"text\":\". \"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" screamed not in pain, but in \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"joy, \"},{\"text\":\"as he was dragged into the nothingness, \"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"text\":\"his body dissolving into a billion strands of data and thought. Stalin, with the last of his strength, hurled himself through the emergency hatch as the base imploded into a silent crater.\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Stalin returned to Moscow, silent, haunted. The project was erased. \"},{\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"text\":\"Gravesoul\"},{\"text\":\" was never mentioned again.\\nBut sometimes, when the wind blew right over the Kremlin, you could hear a whisper not of this Earth.\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
						"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"From beyond the veil, \"},{\"color\":\"red\",\"text\":\"Unknown\"},{\"text\":\" had claimed a servant.\\nAnd he was \"},{\"italic\":true,\"text\":\"not done yet\"},{\"text\":\".\"}],\"text\":\"\"}"
					]
					resolved: 1b
					title: "坠入深渊"
				}
			}
			id: "3E37C16F9D587288"
			rewards: [{
				command: "/give @p written_book{pages:['[\"\",{\"text\":\"It began in the underground laboratories beneath the Kremlin. Stalin, no longer content with conquering nations, had set his gaze upon the cosmos, not the stars, but what lay beneath them. \"},{\"text\":\"The VOID\",\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"light_purple\"},{\"text\":\".\",\"color\":\"reset\"}]','[\"\",{\"text\":\"The absence between realities. A place no man was meant to see.\\\\nBeside him stood \"},{\"text\":\"Gravesoul\",\"color\":\"dark_purple\"},{\"text\":\", the empire\\\\u2019s greatest mind. His obsession with dark matter had consumed him. He had long theorized that the universe was stitched together by an invisible thread.\",\"color\":\"reset\"}]'],title:\"Into the Abyss\",author:\"The Archivist\",display:{Lore:[\"A Tale of Dark Research and the Rise of Unknown\"]}}"
